{"name":"北斗","name_en":"Beidou","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"我是北斗，听过我的「南十字」船队吗？如果你也喜欢冒险，那就跟着我吧。我罩你。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c32048be61f3ade3b08226ac510c556b_8694650441614847824.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ad588e39f63b8547496d921c95e27ebd_5103236660723017829.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/81e88f7f3d5974ee2dc83f303ec9e13b_6822098894802676822.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e5d472c3ae5d7b0aa2ca710756734d48_8781849891744811900.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·切磋","title_en":"","text":"想切磋的话，我随时奉陪。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0eb0de9fe129bc0f9da7bb1650632e05_9080540853671737288.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2fbb63fccb89b1390d4cbbb085081d56_2748490168612700293.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8deb0c705b2557454cf8ecc1751e518c_3762076970715617100.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/89357fb248642f4a38199f41fab82c83_7316808643719541029.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·畅饮","title_en":"","text":"啊——干完活，喝口酒。真畅快。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/771382fcfe622ba3d77a9bc84399de00_342392083740274693.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/658ea4e13c1d02e901a1323350c6969b_843868519823456364.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/98d8636819711863d32078ed54e0a636_7735643930170715206.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ec4b115295f3ab64b3309f3f37256917_5790484248812785862.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·陆地","title_en":"","text":"难得在陆地上逗留那么久，居然有点不习惯了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5c9daf7919425651b8265fd27f1adb77_4216378842711343684.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5b5f1ee8a1159562f5c88fde0becc1c8_1306765836275170568.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/409d4e29f25eede105671d5467cd8348_8429277214663519037.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c672db4985e0c45810caaa94b9d1a29c_7415835621778014333.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雨的时候","title_en":"","text":"被困荒岛的时候，雨水就是宝贵的淡水来源。嗯…虽然现在是用不上啦。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ff8ce77fa36d2206605c7a73b047437d_4855663220079372039.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/86338cc8e7f4cc06579787c255e0c274_3761069965753471077.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6ea16c957af92080d54c37f93b4a87fc_9155351991715978925.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/844083508c35848cab327d0999d0a619_5630770789169755216.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"喂，打雷而已。在海上不用怕，在陆地上，就更不用怕了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3bcdeb0d7227e6bbab921eae551a1588_7859263121218075261.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d4aacb2c1a91cfa540b6f3b8264e081e_3876961981042530883.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d6756d09ccbdc3f897cee1aa511a72b0_3692866860365349937.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c793fbcb401efdb79689d5785d358f81_6046846218175950139.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"起风的时候","title_en":"","text":"这天气，很适合出航啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f002115c53829177e46d854449711790_6416517624936017974.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/78a50a55a449fc054b9a9ccd3f692fac_5763171680706665076.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/805b2f6770bc4d0f4f6ed51fb5ae1b01_8728041347779043243.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b69c8992b8baa3886f4ec408eb6178e4_8637906297259451196.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"刮大风了","title_en":"","text":"注意扬起来的风沙，别揉眼睛。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e9c30d03171772b83fa3a6ebb350c94a_5425638203932997203.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/71cb6f48eee6e5bac46165673f4f5634_7057339282178186735.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/89340daf62cbcf29bb8cb76bfa53249f_7000752004352492259.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e3b4b4b0ac1ec46a6d1901cd99864319_2496711580793927710.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"哟，早。我准备出发了，一起来？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/de980b06dacf6068620dae57fef196bf_6093717221304165568.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/276f2f414056ade45890d926525579c9_8857145944085134035.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/070e4e95071659550f54424ef79c1f3e_8610935669780025188.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5423cf4ec902818ef820083bf08e3e0c_2792411371473363874.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"去香菱那吃午饭吧。你别说，这大锅热油炒出来的，还真和海上的烤鱼腌肉不一样。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/338d9f0417492112d4f0bd371c6bdc8f_2071592607860995755.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2181f958a540b780cb946c57a708b8ce_1807643182954324534.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/179f602d89dc52490a3b305dad360f1b_3508958696455805014.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4fe87d39f7473db450e8a3af50649d8c_9180894287911134013.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"好，出发喝酒去喽！嗯？哈哈哈，平时没人卖酒给你是吧？那不如——","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fdae11966f7fa2fa333a394470feaa05_2638804827587064600.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3225cce2745d20c5d18e49cbfb97f5c9_927071723653616020.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/cf44f16cf9fb86774f559ce9a02509dd_2667557927475374815.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/261252d3b9c9d79496b036c6dc38a4a9_106763948961157951.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"这时间过得可真快。去吧，一帆风顺。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2f14ea7a31d0b96ece870c720da92ee9_497083938061905387.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e7084821e342f617d9e2f9f15927d4a4_1839998192886574300.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3aef479f4ad7f9146edd40ef520d1674_1071455822518310649.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c0ca366e2f8976231869603fae398b67_4256297102748183957.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于北斗自己","title_en":"","text":"航海准备，兄弟们，各就各位，全新的冒险要开始了！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/512be9e7556924ccea3689375644e9e2_8903576878237691773.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a7497658ce043430e9de690e38dc78cf_5815501664779722705.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/57be086663f918150e76aa49b6f9129e_1083321561345589621.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/259833c267e1093b758664ae617bd3a3_5069453160826110055.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·称呼","title_en":"","text":"我是老大，你是我兄弟，没问题吧？哈？这些叫法太老土？行。那就按你喜欢的方式叫吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/bc682404969dceb4e668b3957e5d58b9_2566032803777920448.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e8dd007399c0092acde3a8296e588113_6254006143006724283.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/72da5b44898ea4b9a4fe8997f525102b_2750165109594782252.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8d98ec08d8880314002d69d274f0c4a0_1900731182702073643.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·识人","title_en":"","text":"我认人很准。当你见过大海，那么普通人脸上的小水花，可就太好读懂了。哈哈，所以，我第一眼就认准了你这个家伙。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c267dd4a1b709ac34f858a1de5fd4b4c_8497253602849307887.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7d27cdac0b57a60a93354f91d3e02406_4778190638362957003.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/16e5179760f2f1f5ca0c5253511c52de_1641844205789570722.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/48e514d1dce702f89517eb6ec88908ee_6968441892566021524.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·选择","title_en":"","text":"你是我选择的船员，是我选择的兄弟。就说这一点，都够我自豪很久。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/de47ac27e5103868e1add8b03839b423_8803696146318629968.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/48b1ee7c7eff64fb0c694dfff74e697a_5662894152259722142.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a324acf044c852528a4092a222b760e5_8779218063822069127.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d4bf5b48e4f85cfc3c2cbf63d68af91e_932825978996933485.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"在那些没有「神之眼」的家伙心中，拥有「神之眼」，获得了神的认可的人，应该是旗帜吧。那么，旗帜就该有旗帜的样子。我是这样鞭策自己的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0b8041facf20aa26f5ccaa14feefeeda_9076164098981327237.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/5f91f6da1ebaaf91cbddd96663c828cb_5937848535867516520.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2092407ecd410781af0c4d9baf3e3aa8_3333231093827977237.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1e2183d7eb96667aa82a417331c3a128_6042688672545997551.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享","title_en":"","text":"遇到难题了吗？不知道如何向前的话，总之先迈出第一步，后面的道路就会自然而然地展开了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/88a42ab8dc53a0799862d64b92dda8b3_1517362240356701857.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/de1186993ed7aa80f4d9677bf3b3dca4_5469792749002171130.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e04f19f7af320d59501eadacd5323f91_5897098038400876871.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/18414724124c5fd02d453c1f73ea6268_3540939340750654477.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"每次远航回来看见石鸢的时候，就说明差不多快到家了。海上的景色看多了难免单调，相比之下，虽说是猛禽，但那副自在翱翔的模样，总觉得亲切可爱。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9cdd101028c15f58d0b6651425fb2ca5_5053594721219837677.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/38aa950ab19a8aa275b0b8421e3e9a0e_5508554459031031241.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/bdb126ff1f9419792150213bce9250cb_6226130433020268331.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c83b30061e86b5b4ab842d7a9cb28ab6_2155106938895876192.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于凝光·璃月七星","title_en":"","text":"凝光啊，从「璃月七星」的角度上来说已经做得很好了吧。只是，我要负责的对象从来就是我的船和兄弟们，不是什么「璃月七星」啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fa7ef056bdb6e895ac41bec61db32a0a_6800966144258240601.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/32b1b89cdc10038ad131e9d0820b0e43_9173716448126569896.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/100f1e11a14adbe4ec4210e5ca09bf50_7087073617844518659.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0f1af5e65d738fb25a7f0dc7e01e3630_65453441952131381.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于凝光·态度","title_en":"","text":"凝光一向不怎么坦率，但她曾经很直接地表露过对我的不满。哈哈，不过啊，喜欢和讨厌都是她自己的事情，我是不可能动摇的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/55e1ceef364f57fd3c9be6bfd638624e_4542390018963869395.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/919a77565beeca977d32c3e163579dab_7749603190295758519.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1087e651867419005119fccc4fd68f65_1342607864136145029.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a70cc2d221f1e162cb71da9a85b3afff_8568380897706764584.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于香菱·好厨艺","title_en":"","text":"香菱的一手好菜，可是我们一众人在远航时的念想。没力气的时候，要是想想干煸绝云椒椒那满嘴留香的滋味，都能精神几分。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ba37e44db834574aa29c50416ae8cc10_2095087790232609352.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/fef910d257f848bb595c74bae3bba2f3_1519087192815843867.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/89379344f29f0391c51726143e0b04af_486310869991811718.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e84119fc12a050b9e47641c8135f1bf8_6707608868297311424.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于香菱·试吃","title_en":"","text":"香菱啊，她偶尔也会用一些说不上好滋味的食材，做出一些很是了不得的味道。不过嘛，没有尝试就不会有进步，我倒是挺乐意帮她试吃的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/36778c32f0cb0563e94a16521fcad56b_2172223868738679843.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/cf30b31e123004db8bf5b18fcf6cb18b_2354110717152839499.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/22e4f8a28203c74365220849c39051e9_4721101885381306668.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/319cb8167db2d6c540fb3021a8ed6f94_3235161075563323961.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于钟离","title_en":"","text":"你说「往生堂」的那位先生吗？兄弟们有时会聊起他的传言，听上去是个很有意思的人啊。嗯，有机会去结交一下吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/21573fcccebced11d8e257693e811a4e_2953327528826216846.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/99fb7a69fbb2a2b7c41e7c7f509363e3_1899178221774531001.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3a72a94b93aefd8a0393548436785ba5_7436116093476378258.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7c774a3e3487c3acf95733eb9ea2da3d_3243702620591279512.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于魈","title_en":"","text":"有一年海灯节前夕，船队在归航时遭遇了风暴，紧赶慢赶才在入夜时分回到了璃月港。那时候海灯早就散了。我却在孤云阁的方向，看到了空中悬着一个少年模样的仙人。想必就如传闻一样，在人们看不见的地方，也有人在守护这个璃月港吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e760e74bf7190f1b659742de93548c41_1579737760633198516.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/509156173a16123c7e88213c99aa7c44_6680491946220151596.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/7779d89a15721cad196f415e707f47dc_2004371880046878944.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/02701be79bab89e344a93d9adb68f2ae_5456327158965341590.mp3"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于甘雨","title_en":"","text":"我和甘雨那丫头私交不错！但你也知道，她是「璃月七星」的秘书，「七星」不待见我那可不是一天两天了。哈，我倒是无所谓，要连累了那丫头可不行。嗯，对外还是保密得好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/046315f5eb5d293d3051bedc0bb1db6d_2826749258737365575.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/423196f94551f7de9bd9bffdb01eb7f9_1139620297945570069.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2cf60dc3abd21ed90720c0cfa80e220e_490300720703322815.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f1d5b5ed8ae074799f011269b5c05ff5_6797777213052354000.mp3"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于辛焱","title_en":"","text":"哈，很有意思的丫头！船上的兄弟们也有喜欢听她「摇滚」的。嗯…我本人？怎么说呢，虽然在某些方面跟辛焱有共同话题，但我的音乐品味却是另一方面的…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/13a64fb57bc2fd5364abb9774f93ed58_3076274495908022238.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b0a39bf65a972ed04bd9ec432e484339_4949287753132875958.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4daba2817b6009fd526917aef635a2d3_986865946579645767.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4dc524265398385ed0b0ef0494d42118_810749756319909411.mp3"}},"line":7},{"title":"关于瑶瑶","title_en":"","text":"瑶瑶这个小家伙啊，总是爱到船上来玩。但她那副扑闪着眼睛，见什么都新奇的样子，让谁都狠不下心来赶她走。唉，差点要打乱出航的计划。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/b59aff740493e6472a42b09d239e27ad_5750436215017349410.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a6a189d24961d2f67402f265c3d34043_559028116170636155.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a478f93fa1b590b98354263942151415_5924699425980932466.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4b285a62895d95baf77376ee24e792d7_7290627730180849537.mp3"}},"line":8},{"title":"关于枫原万叶","title_en":"","text":"听说万叶那小子在天守阁外挡了雷电将军的一刀，不简单嘛！嗯…战争结束后，他回了我们南十字船队，说是继续和我们同行一段时间。我当然是非常欢迎了，如果哪天他决定要独自踏上下一段旅程，我再打一壶好酒为他送行，哈哈。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ab99d70d3cad880432088753d2ee865a_7483205934397938949.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/eee8cd19c7769cceddae61eb62694283_6289589024532517638.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/465308f947f6c8618785cdbb183ba8ce_4316357587839330533.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/74d8d6e50566511e489ec13b92d1a4cf_8585983082070471064.mp3"}},"line":9},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其一","title_en":"","text":"想要踏上我的「死兆星」号，得先回答我一个问题。大海之中充满凶险，告诉我——你为什么想上我的船？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/36e6161828889078ae9f762dd01bbd61_4968038369461812727.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0d5e5dd6440b7c69b39a3e5aeb730873_6804519324782812290.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ae210c2648af7e0610aa35f1ef1eff0c_4633498288246142297.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/95be6ece0251c19aaa9fa5c41cb01a76_8764351410200308534.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其二","title_en":"","text":"那些关于我的传奇故事？哈哈哈，那是兄弟们看重，才在夸我的时候添油加醋。不过，你要问我怕不怕在出海的时候遇到什么魔物，那自然是不怕的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/bc655ea66d2c6eb148340d4e3ee0cf51_2580195376129381634.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f8210e05878abc2be82dd4ae45e27663_3194542295960849971.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/de9d5d5423a80413bac630302de74a21_8524025255412506919.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/41def93e1911572ff8047786e51d80d0_2368616413362480886.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其三","title_en":"","text":"问我帮助平民的用意？哈，哪有什么用意不用意的。谁的人生还没有个低谷。我的帮助是小事，但对他们而言，迈不迈得过去那道坎，可能就是两条路啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/2380ae63fb20986f1ab3705c29142f5a_7766756836108476580.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d1fd0178f3b95bbfff20d9cd0738d415_7335437955617227038.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/881d22719904426d091a8e8af1d33f43_3598135780813548336.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3278c458cc38af8f967527f4fd63ff94_5009977946601937020.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其四","title_en":"","text":"我经历过痛苦的时光。小时候没摩拉买吃的，只好偷人家树上的果子，讨了几年生活。等到有了自己的船队，还是被趾高气昂的商人们排挤在外。但是，这些事当作茶余饭后的笑谈讲给你听，就足够了，我绝不会让你再经历一遍。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0753da1b8631e288b388325e9bd3edb9_9016907779047118105.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c6931fa75aa0bf2aa3359461b0b4f21b_5727109698546913157.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/890f624f5fc37b834526ca8721909368_8817516464816479836.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/d32ba252cacc840e8a50afd2b739351a_1613234192045511698.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其五","title_en":"","text":"追随我的兄弟有很多，我问过，我也记得他们每一个人上船的理由。你是很特别的。我知道你还有需要完成的事情，我不会授予你职务和头衔。但无论你的旅途去往何方，「死兆星」号上，永远都有你的位置。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4866f27171ada1b25fece4dbaf2772a8_1855687376893837433.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/c0f2276a3981361e6fd45fd525db5b56_6526654021084007519.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/872281a97cb05004222dc3c471086a6d_7267237701745235044.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/707e98d98c2097faf1f8a9e214f61d9d_8027333863042451116.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"北斗的爱好","title_en":"","text":"爱好啊…我想想。冒险算一个，掌舵算一个，交朋友算一个，喝酒算一个，吃好吃的算一个…啧，一个手都数不过来啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/23135b2b58085c1b106b6e48075573f2_3839462869532471613.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8f565605f2fca5502af86e6f60c538ef_1158471317016597210.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/dcb3388b941962300fa4e041b298f579_6002489791325728741.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e9a84890a8861bd8376224fbf0ff0a64_5667947045928857568.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"北斗的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"搞得定的事不必烦恼，搞不定的事烦恼也没有意义。我就这样过得快快活活的。哦，要是你遇到什么想不通的事情，你可以来找我。我帮你一起解决。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/f50b1896ed9be948d5cdbc733c80a5a2_6815474967957515225.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/8f26e6766456db3aabf027e4fb5c0108_8704387324092168233.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/e814d83f34f5a2f6718eb259233e7185_7168032826497930850.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/9b3d2d47cce6a98e0764e8963953d3be_3954020456739781434.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物","title_en":"","text":"我喜欢味道重的菜！什么炝炒肉片啊，麻婆豆腐啊我就很喜欢。能填饱肚子，大家围坐一圈一起吃的时候，气氛也会变得火热火热的。哈，说得我都想去吃一顿了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/21294f8bc566cf9f91723f941b478f21_8411707297574982682.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/015a6296a27bbaa94d4ad5799df79cca_5542165994221340513.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ca54957247b022ef3556dea2a7c301c9_8559505762986304650.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/eccb5cc66efbefb4e2583c511e86f573_5301292993528460499.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"讨厌的食物","title_en":"","text":"我不太喜欢吃凉菜冷盘。有这慢悠悠开胃的功夫，鱼都能烤熟几条了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6a1eb7331787b8a2a8b26d56d2de3f66_4898188896894979285.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/6ba60cc5a8dc2e76c0881b05ff7fd4e3_3568296376673074551.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/ec5c6208105cecf2067047ac8d31bf7d_567720942994664578.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/93bb2b0fc35459198fd4bb1727989cea_3474110132486906979.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","title_en":"","text":"好味道，我喜欢！有米饭吗，帮忙添两碗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/0cca51cc5d97c2c589f0744b53336e51_1704264683602994836.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/65848a82c6a2685a97bd6c7b14e0447c_5270009171286929428.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/4c332708d7a609537d099814d003dc93_4924499090857132247.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/3be7e06a573b38f794b570afd87e6e1a_9007659792210889330.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","title_en":"","text":"你的手艺真不错，让人心情也变得不一样了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/1c3c0f56daf932bf8c718079a7b66355_8290990795509344988.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/30e398d98fb93113816944da1ca6f1f9_3762189989107304753.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/a8ba945b7cc755df9a5685f173f6425c_7070710617360404101.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/805b01db202de579e83bf4b15bf24bc2_1705417068080310484.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","title_en":"","text":"菜是好菜，这就够了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/13/271e5e